  "description": "A shy, quiet guy meets a tough, bold girl and embarks on a journey of romance to fight the standards of society and find out who they really are.\n\n[Pre-serialization](https://comic.naver.com/bestChallenge/list?titleId=705050)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/53753232), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/dywhtlstk_), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/rockin_sr_0009), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=4397524), [Comico](https://www.comico.kr/comic/2608), [Bufftoon](https://bufftoon.plaync.com/series/1004060), KToon, [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H037435291), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H037435291), [Qtoon](https://www.qtoon.co.kr/toon/list.mg?tcode=cmmr), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=230374)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://daycomics.com/content/102421), [French](https://www.delitoon.com/detail/daf_0000473)\n\nFrom [RockinKOREA](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wrGsW3QKyvU):\n\nA man named Seha Song grew up hearing that he was feminine from a young age, while a woman named Bada Pi grew up being told that she was masculine since she was a child. These two, who have images opposite to their genders, have grown up receiving anxious attention. Upon the entrance to the university, Seha Song and Bada Pi decide to live in a way that matches the gender, which the society expects them to be. They try to meet up with the standards of others.  \nThis is a self-seeking healing romance story of feminine man Seha Song and manly woman Bada Pi, who resist to be in line with the standards demanded by society.",
